{"4764270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Simulator Survivors", "steam_appid": 4764270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/c2c0dd24919ca862208aff62e4d87c0a.poster.avif?t=1782583798\" aria-label=\"stacked enemy horde hurling barrels\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/c2c0dd24919ca862208aff62e4d87c0a.webm?t=1782583798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/c2c0dd24919ca862208aff62e4d87c0a.mp4?t=1782583798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulator Survivors</strong> is a <strong>3D</strong>, <strong>vertical</strong> Survivors-like with <strong>physics</strong>-infused <strong>arcade action</strong>. It demands <strong>navigational skills </strong>and <strong>quick reflexes</strong>, and rewards <strong>replays</strong> and <strong>exploration</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💪 FEEL YOUR PROGRESS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <strong>FEEL</strong> getting stronger by the second, picking up color-coded loot which gradually bumps one of four skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And just when you're comfortably overpowering THEM, THEY will put you right back in that tight spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/66d556fa6f75c28b39586431c33dfd07.poster.avif?t=1782583798\" aria-label=\"zooming through enemies, collecting lots of gems\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/66d556fa6f75c28b39586431c33dfd07.webm?t=1782583798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/66d556fa6f75c28b39586431c33dfd07.mp4?t=1782583798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏃 STAY IN THE FLOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no <strong>STOPPING</strong> you. You run for your life - until it inevitably ends. Then you run again on the same map, no loading screen, with everything just as you left it - for better or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will <strong>never </strong>be prompted to make miniscule +1% decisions every couple seconds, promise!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏗️ PHYSICS FOR FUN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push physics objects, hop over them, use them to climb vertically. Enemies can do the same, or might just throw cars blocking your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deaths are enacted as a hilariously painful ragdoll sequence in slow motion. Your runs always end with a smile. 😊</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/267bf843f574153d56a11797dcf694e4.poster.avif?t=1782583798\" aria-label=\"backbreaking ragdoll death, coin drops\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/267bf843f574153d56a11797dcf694e4.webm?t=1782583798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/267bf843f574153d56a11797dcf694e4.mp4?t=1782583798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💀 GO LOOT YOURSELF!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you die, your ragdoll corpse drops your run's earnings. You only need to pick  up that coin in the next run ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bloody corpses remain on the map. Must be a glitch in the simulation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤖 MOTIVATIONAL ASSISTANCE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI narrator cares about you just as much as the average corporate game publisher. You will feel right at home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER: All puns are entirely intentional. No corpses are being harmed. You are fine.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/c2c0dd24919ca862208aff62e4d87c0a.poster.avif?t=1782583798\" aria-label=\"stacked enemy horde hurling barrels\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/c2c0dd24919ca862208aff62e4d87c0a.webm?t=1782583798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/c2c0dd24919ca862208aff62e4d87c0a.mp4?t=1782583798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulator Survivors</strong> is a <strong>3D</strong>, <strong>vertical</strong> Survivors-like with <strong>physics</strong>-infused <strong>arcade action</strong>. It demands <strong>navigational skills </strong>and <strong>quick reflexes</strong>, and rewards <strong>replays</strong> and <strong>exploration</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💪 FEEL YOUR PROGRESS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <strong>FEEL</strong> getting stronger by the second, picking up color-coded loot which gradually bumps one of four skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And just when you're comfortably overpowering THEM, THEY will put you right back in that tight spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/66d556fa6f75c28b39586431c33dfd07.poster.avif?t=1782583798\" aria-label=\"zooming through enemies, collecting lots of gems\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/66d556fa6f75c28b39586431c33dfd07.webm?t=1782583798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/66d556fa6f75c28b39586431c33dfd07.mp4?t=1782583798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏃 STAY IN THE FLOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no <strong>STOPPING</strong> you. You run for your life - until it inevitably ends. Then you run again on the same map, no loading screen, with everything just as you left it - for better or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will <strong>never </strong>be prompted to make miniscule +1% decisions every couple seconds, promise!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏗️ PHYSICS FOR FUN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push physics objects, hop over them, use them to climb vertically. Enemies can do the same, or might just throw cars blocking your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deaths are enacted as a hilariously painful ragdoll sequence in slow motion. Your runs always end with a smile. 😊</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/267bf843f574153d56a11797dcf694e4.poster.avif?t=1782583798\" aria-label=\"backbreaking ragdoll death, coin drops\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/267bf843f574153d56a11797dcf694e4.webm?t=1782583798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/extras/267bf843f574153d56a11797dcf694e4.mp4?t=1782583798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💀 GO LOOT YOURSELF!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you die, your ragdoll corpse drops your run's earnings. You only need to pick  up that coin in the next run ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bloody corpses remain on the map. Must be a glitch in the simulation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤖 MOTIVATIONAL ASSISTANCE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI narrator cares about you just as much as the average corporate game publisher. You will feel right at home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER: All puns are entirely intentional. No corpses are being harmed. You are fine.</p>", "short_description": "Seeking data donors for an arcade-action, physics-infused Survivors-like with frantic 0-10 minute runs. Launch vehicles, scale buildings, die viscerally, loot your own corpses! Participate in this perfectly safe simulation to help Greedy Game Corp. optimize their monetization strategies. Come die!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/7dd3adaf3637deabb3caef5ca391b00e7bec5005/header.jpg?t=1782583798", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/2a13624d53cc247a5344af1ba8412f1ab3ef136e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782583798", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764270/2a13624d53cc247a5344af1ba8412f1ab3ef136e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782583798", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br